{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>5月19日，河北。外婆不聽勸非要親寶寶的腳不可，結果不小心染上腳氣（香港腳、足癬），上嘴唇腫得像香腸一樣。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134909687360131072842301.jpeg/WmJw5OUjL0-vvA_2UQ4Ote-f68TQICNMiNZUTojWVE4\" alt=\"河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病，腫得像香腸一樣。（微博截圖）\"><figcaption>河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病，腫得像香腸一樣。（微博截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>BB腳部汗腺發達也會有香港腳　嘴唇脆弱易受感染：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907293549203456530742.jpeg/x4XzORlIsRYze4B17KOcvzysYBrXxB3cWxFuOVsRbjk\" alt=\"河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）\"><figcaption>河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907298159005696679283.jpeg/TsSG_6YLHzbvFCljtE59-UAZyDn9EbWDiHt_z4h7f88\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907300558278656801732.jpeg/DI_lNZ-XyHuM7Ynqf4WsOE8ocxD1LGHovnyEZL58hGQ\"><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907296007196672675381.jpeg/LFck7FlBifM8D3ocDJ8wjryofWRTKQqeNKIOwjSiDsI\" alt=\"河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）\"><figcaption>河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907298347749376968012.jpeg/UtJjbeVKkR4544yml-gYu3bmyB3rP0FMYy-xnGMvsZw\" alt=\"河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）\"><figcaption>河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907300558278656724690.jpeg/pQ8k6nYod1K0QPyOA99WwrTI_Yg5EpnyTk07Vk5NO1Y\" alt=\"河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）\"><figcaption>河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907302919802880986124.jpeg/ApkgRGQcmIhlFvLQB1rEC64wumzDgSwlS4Ep7kuBKe4\" alt=\"河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）\"><figcaption>河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@經視直播）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907293477900288792504.jpeg/48Nw8oYgpMsAx54EnMFAiP7vFgdOdTW8VEF6EFRBehA\" alt=\"河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@都市頻道）\"><figcaption>河北一名女子親吻嬰兒的腳以致嘴唇染上腳氣病。（微博@都市頻道）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907296028168192012398.jpeg/QPj1UyZ3wAOJZ6J8pxNjWLbJHGnjd7li1-J-wtfifsI\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907302835916800840592.jpeg/_18g35ijeyIqHewtOI-sb75lHO66HOG0m6ATx5ugE8c\"><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134907292383186944240683.jpeg/ofH8FUWXqaI1iWwP85EBEoBftNF1HnVblA3SNpQN0jY\"><p>醫生提醒：小寶寶通常活動量較大，腳部汗腺也十分發達，這使得他們的腳部容易產生大量汗液。</p><p>潮濕環境容易滋生細菌，甚至可能存在腳氣問題。在這樣的情況下，家長們在與寶寶親密互動時，一定要格外注意衛生問題。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260523/1134908828828045312318952.jpeg/5WRVeZrsUDCIGY9kcXdDHq5SajY1iuiY5d8GJuXfBiY\" alt=\"家長們在與寶寶親密互動時，一定要格外注意衛生問題。（picsea/unsplash）\"><figcaption>家長們在與寶寶親密互動時，一定要格外注意衛生問題。（picsea/unsplash）</figcaption></figure><p>醫生建議家長：</p><p>避免給寶寶穿不透氣的鞋襪，勤換洗；</p><p>單獨清洗寶寶的貼身衣物鞋襪，必要時日光暴曬；</p><p>避免在公共場所玩耍時赤腳，或穿着別人（包括患足癬的家人）的鞋襪。</p><p>延伸閱讀：皮膚痕｜皮膚不明痕癢潛藏5類疾病！養成這4個習慣改善皮膚搔癢👇👇👇</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661228675189968896734925.jpeg/2j9tkTJraLlL7HgnUpKSBj9WcyHyr7QE-0BgrPtAYKw\" alt=\"延伸閱讀：皮膚痕｜皮膚不明痕癢潛藏5類疾病！養成這4個習慣改善皮膚搔癢（01製圖）\"><figcaption>延伸閱讀：皮膚痕｜皮膚不明痕癢潛藏5類疾病！養成這4個習慣改善皮膚搔癢（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661228677325000704971802.jpeg/04D_Oi7VKpjda58knCyJ_Po2KGAoE1yyEuF4thLheLY\" alt=\"皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）\"><figcaption>皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661228679732662272571683.jpeg/meaJ73UEOY52PvAZdmTULm8FFnX-jDU8o508waOdPME\" alt=\"皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）\"><figcaption>皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661228682261958656516079.jpeg/KWI-RgTrhRXI4QaFM4LzTNhjWieTeMlMaQEBMWkBATE\" alt=\"皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）\"><figcaption>皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661228685000970240230148.jpeg/CQoB_hhRXLEILIHEFvur-X5jXwnO9-cNJ4Uw4CeFMOA\" alt=\"皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）\"><figcaption>皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661228687618347008965402.jpeg/H57-tYms6Pqsxpw_Dyv227jAIiPikBBWracyia2nMok\" alt=\"皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）\"><figcaption>皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661228690336387072347961.jpeg/px16K_iNm2JwqrN3Lmh-ccWfVkQaACrmbvw7iW78O4k\" alt=\"皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）\"><figcaption>皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221024/661228692760825856317620.jpeg/pJGy5W7cvOBAgQw_4vMNLQzuVTpCUMCj-5cbxPuXG8Q\" alt=\"皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）\"><figcaption>皮膚不明發癢原因（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-24T05:22:57.953065+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":747,"images":21,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}